/Pg 51 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1104 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 481 0 R
/E (To address potential in-sample circularity, where a state's own market price is included when estimating the weekly benchmark line against which it is evaluated, we implemented a leave-one-out cross-validation. For each state and snapshot week, the regression line was refitted excluding that specific target state. Refitting the benchmark without each state in turn gives a mean absolute disagreement of 0.63 log-odds \(about 1.7 margin points at the typical slope of 0.37\), so the small gaps are not only an in-sample artefact.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
