1406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 506 0 R
/E (Errors across states are correlated, because a national swing moves many states together, so 16 races are far fewer than 16 independent observations. We report the average signed error \(bias\) separately from the spread, give no intervals or significance tests, and make no claim about calibration. Every comparison is descriptive.)
/Pg 76 0 R
/K [2]
>>
