/P 506 0 R
/E (Kansas, Minnesota and Iowa are the focus states selected in Analysis 2 \(Section 5.2.2\). All 12 competitive states are compared with their results regardless. While locating a results source, an AI assistant used in the analysis read one race page \(Iowa\) and, while testing a fetch, search results that reported the Kansas outcome. The person running the analysis opened results pages for Kansas and Minnesota after Analysis 2 had been run, so the focus states were chosen from pre-election data before their outcomes were seen by that person.)
/Pg 76 0 R
/K [4]
