/T (This was an independent project, undertaken out of interest in American politics, polling and prediction markets, and it used AI-assisted coding and analysis throughout. The code, data files and documentation are shared so that every figure can be checked and the analysis rerun on certified results.)
/E (This was an independent project, undertaken out of interest in American politics, polling and prediction markets, and it used AI-assisted coding and analysis throughout. The code, data files and documentation are shared so that every figure can be checked and the analysis rerun on certified results.)
