1841 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 543 0 R
/E (Each column repeats the main results of Analyses 1 and 4 with a different polling average built from the same surveys \(Section 5.5.2\). Cross-state fits use states with at least two surveys in the 21-day window and need at least eight states. The long difference runs from Sep 1 to Nov 1 with at least one survey in the 21-day window at both ends \(HC3 standard errors\). The final horizon is Nov 2, and the poll error uses the head-to-head races. The baseline reproduces the Analysis 2 average on Nov 1 exactly \(largest difference 0.0\).)
/Pg 113 0 R
/K [3]
>>
