/Title (Interpretation. Polls and markets carry much of the same information about which races favour which party, and they differ most in close races and in how they price uncertainty. The main fact about accuracy in this cycle is a common error of about 4.5 points toward the Democrats, which the market shared. Neither source can be called the better forecaster from this evidence.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1859 0 R
/Next 5765 0 R
>>
endobj
