7930 0 obj
<<
/Title (The central finding on accuracy was a shared miss. The Democrats beat the final poll average in all 15 head-to-head races, by 4.52 points on average \(RMSE 5.26\), and the common shift accounts for about 74% of the squared error. The market shared the miss, and its lean toward the Republicans in close races put it further from the outcomes than the polls.)
/Dest [98 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 7945 0 R
/Next 7916 0 R
>>
