/Title (Leave-one-out check. Dropping each of the 15 states in turn \(Sep 1 start, k = 1\) gives slopes between +0.090 \(Arkansas dropped\) and +0.111 \(Ohio dropped\), so no single state drives the result. With 14 to 15 observations the HC3 p-values are optimistic, and the stated p below 0.001 should not be read literally. Six specifications were tried and the analysis was added after the weekly results were seen, so we treat it as supportive but exploratory.)
